    "title": "One Block for Minecraft Maps",
    "description": "One Block Mod for Minecraft Pocket Edition adds 1 block that you can expanse to real world and chest with all items and weapons you need. You can explore the map with your friends or alone in this epic addon!\r\n\r\nOne Block is an exciting and innovative addons that completely transforms your Mincraft experience. With this add-on, you start with just a single cube in the middle of a void, and from there, your world expands and evolves as you break and place blocks. Each blok you break reveals a new surprise, whether it's valuable resources, dangerous mobs, or mysterious structures. It's like unwrapping a gift with every blok you destroy! The progression is unpredictable and keeps you constantly on your toes, as you never know what awaits you beneath the surface. \r\n\r\nThe mod introduces a fresh and challenging gameplay style, where you must strategically plan your moves and make the most out of every block you encounter. With each step, you shape the landscape and uncover new opportunities for survival and exploration. Whether you're a seasoned Mycraft player looking for a fresh twist or a newcomer seeking an unpredictable adventure, One Block mods are sure to captivate you with its ever-changing world of possibilities.\r\n\r\nTo load our crafty craft products, you must first download the Blok addon from the app page on your device, then launch our Block Launcher. Select the add-on you require | map | skinseed | mc |mini games | skin | mods and click the install button, after which the addons will install and you will be able to open the multicraft game where you will need to open the settings and select a new add-on, after which you will be able to begin your pixel world with a new wonderful mod / addon Oneblok!\r\n \r\n\ud83d\udca5Advantages of our applications Skyblock\ud83d\udca5 \r\n\u2705 Automatic installation in one click \r\n\u2705 Large selection of addons / skins / maps / minigames / textures / shaders / texture packs \r\n\u2705 Constantly updating applications \r\n\u2705 Extended description \r\n\u2705Completely free \r\n\u2705Realistic graphics with ray tracing technology \r\n\u2705 Huge selection of different mc skin and textures \r\n\u2705Regular updates of all mod / texture / skins / maps \r\n \r\nWe added RTX shaders to our Oneblock mod so you can see the image in full HD. You can certainly tell the change in illumination thanks to ray tracing technology!\r\n\r\nThank you for choosing our free Minecraft Oneblok - play and enjoy this addon with your friends or colleagues, also install our other addons | mods | maps | skinseed | mc | texture | mini games | skins | master mc for Bedrock Edition. \r\n \r\n\ud83d\udd3bDISCLAIMER: This is not an official Mojang product and is in no way affiliated with Mojang AB. The Minecraft name, the Minecraft trademark, and the Minecraft assets are the property of Mojang AB or their respected owner. One Block Mod follows the relevant usage guidelines at https://account.mojang.com/documents/brand_guidelines.\ud83d\udd3b",
